Folders: 
    Assignment1 contains:
        the base starter code for the first of the assignments
        the input file used (this is a publicly accessible file from Kaggle) 
        the student instructional handout (which includes the test cases and rubrics used)  
    Assignment2 contains:
        the student instructional handout (which includes the test cases and rubrics used)
        MyMaps.jar file containing completed, compiled code for this assignment
        tv.csv input file (input to run with MyMaps.jar) 
        NOTE: MyMaps.jar can be run from VSCode using the command: java -jar MyMaps.jar
              Ensure the input file tv.csv is in the same directory    

Files:  
    2027 CCSC Nifty Assignment.docx contains the abstract for this Nifty Assignment proposal 
    index.html is the online site used to host this nifty assignment on the site: https://beautiful-sunflower-62e8f1.netlify.app
    Lecture_HashTables.pptx is the powerpoint used for the lecture 
    Lecture_HashTablesHandout.docx is the student handout for the lecture
            

